<html><head><title>Invisible Outcomes</title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">In addition to the fact that the final product may be unpredictable, many outcomes are </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">invisible and intangible</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">. </span><span style="margin: 0px">This</span><span style="margin: 0px"> is </span><span style="margin: 0px">where</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><span style="margin: 0px">learning</span><span style="margin: 0px"> effect</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">comes</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">into</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">play</span><span style="margin: 0px">. </span><span style="margin: 0px">A </span><span style="margin: 0px">desired</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">outcome</span><span style="margin: 0px"> is </span><span style="margin: 0px">that</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">all</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">participants</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">learn</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">throughout</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">collaboration</span><span style="margin: 0px">. </span><span style="margin: 0px">Learning </span><span style="margin: 0px">can</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">occur</span><span style="margin: 0px"> on a </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><span style="margin: 0px">cognitive</span><span style="margin: 0px"> level</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">, in </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">skills</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">, or in </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><span style="margin: 0px">development of </span><span style="margin: 0px">values</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span sty